361 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 774 0 R
/ActualText (Setup Speed: CRA sets up a new React app quickly with one command, making it very beginner-friendly, while Vite offers an even faster setup and project creation, with near-instant startup times due to its optimized build process.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 775 0 R
/ActualText (Performance: CRA uses Webpack, which can be slower during development because it rebuilds the entire application every time you save a file while Vite leverages modern browser features and an optimized development server, which rebuilds only the changed parts, leading to much faster hot module replacement \(HMR\) and overall development performance.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
